WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.001
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.001 --> 00:00:03.002
This is "Late Night."

00:00:03.002 --> 00:00:04.170
We're so happy to be
with you tonight

00:00:04.170 --> 00:00:06.138
and, now, we're going
to get to the news.

00:00:06.138 --> 00:00:08.207
Eleven Democratic Senators

00:00:08.207 --> 00:00:10.509
sent a letter
to President Biden yesterday,

00:00:10.509 --> 00:00:14.680
calling on him to explore
options to lower gas prices,

00:00:14.680 --> 00:00:17.550
which has to be so aggravating,

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:19.885
for a guy who's been hawking
Amtrak for 40 years.

00:00:19.885 --> 00:00:22.822
[ Laughter ]
[ As Biden ] Oh,
are gas prices too high?

00:00:22.822 --> 00:00:24.958
God, I wish I had
an idea for you.

00:00:24.958 --> 00:00:26.725
[ Laughter ]

00:00:26.725 --> 00:00:29.195
Florida Governor Ron DeSantis
filed paperwork yesterday

00:00:29.195 --> 00:00:32.399
to run for reelection in 2022,
which, in Florida,

00:00:32.399 --> 00:00:35.468
is just finishing the maze
on the back page of Highlights.

00:00:35.468 --> 00:00:38.071
[ Laughter ]

00:00:38.071 --> 00:00:40.172
The writer who wrote that is
from Florida.

00:00:40.172 --> 00:00:42.041
[ Laughter and applause ]
I don't want anyone to think

00:00:42.041 --> 00:00:44.810
that it's just like us global --
whatever, coastal elites.

00:00:44.810 --> 00:00:46.179
Global elites.

00:00:46.179 --> 00:00:48.381
[ Laughter ]

00:00:48.381 --> 00:00:50.850
Republican Representative
Paul Gosar on Sunday

00:00:50.850 --> 00:00:53.420
tweeted a digitally editade --
edited, excuse me --

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:55.454
animé-style video
that appeared to show him

00:00:55.454 --> 00:00:58.124
attacking Congresswoman
Alexandria Ocasio-Cortez

00:00:58.124 --> 00:00:59.359
and President Joe Biden.

00:00:59.359 --> 00:01:02.795
You edited yourself
into an animé cartoon?

00:01:02.795 --> 00:01:04.563
[ Laughter ]
You're like that kid

00:01:04.563 --> 00:01:07.199
in elementary school
who insists he knows kung fu,

00:01:07.199 --> 00:01:09.235
but legally isn't allowed
to show you.

00:01:09.235 --> 00:01:11.303
[ Laughter and applause ]
"My hands are registered

00:01:11.303 --> 00:01:12.805
with the FBI, so..."

00:01:12.805 --> 00:01:13.973
[ Laughter ]

00:01:13.973 --> 00:01:17.043
Amazon founder Jeff Bezos
jokingly threatened

00:01:17.043 --> 00:01:19.712
actor Leonardo DiCaprio
yesterday on Twitter

00:01:19.712 --> 00:01:22.015
after a video surfaced
showing DiCaprio talking

00:01:22.015 --> 00:01:23.849
with Bezos' girlfriend
at a gala.

00:01:23.849 --> 00:01:25.351
What a scandal!

00:01:25.351 --> 00:01:29.888
DiCaprio was talking to a woman
over the age of 30?!

00:01:29.888 --> 00:01:33.759
[ Laughter and oohs ]

00:01:33.759 --> 00:01:35.528
West Virginia
Senator Joe Manchin

00:01:35.528 --> 00:01:37.296
is reportedly in talks
for a book deal.

00:01:37.296 --> 00:01:39.932
Well, technically, someone else
will write the book,

00:01:39.932 --> 00:01:42.034
then, he'll cut out
all the good parts.

00:01:42.034 --> 00:01:44.971
[ Laughter and ohs ]

00:01:46.371 --> 00:01:47.974
And that's budget comedy.

00:01:47.974 --> 00:01:49.242
[ Laughter ]

00:01:49.242 --> 00:01:52.145
Ooh, you came from budget comedy
and here it is.

00:01:52.145 --> 00:01:54.079
[ Laughter ]

00:01:54.079 --> 00:01:56.916
In a new interview,
New York Mayor-elect Eric Adams

00:01:56.916 --> 00:01:59.852
suggested that cryptocurrency
should be taught in schools.

00:01:59.852 --> 00:02:03.056
Oh, no, are we going to end up
missing this guy?

00:02:03.056 --> 00:02:05.157
[ Laughter ]

00:02:05.157 --> 00:02:07.393
France's Catholic Church
announced yesterday

00:02:07.393 --> 00:02:10.162
that it would financially
compensate sex abuse victims

00:02:10.162 --> 00:02:12.332
by selling assets
or taking on loans,

00:02:12.332 --> 00:02:14.666
which explains this new listing
on Zillow.

00:02:14.666 --> 00:02:18.538
[ Laughter and oohs ]

00:02:18.538 --> 00:02:20.640
[ Cheering ]

00:02:20.640 --> 00:02:22.775
Looks very nice.

00:02:22.775 --> 00:02:25.612
According to a new report,
a 39,000-ton pile

00:02:25.612 --> 00:02:28.481
of unsold clothes
from fast fashion retailers

00:02:28.481 --> 00:02:30.650
has accumulated
in the Chilean desert.

00:02:30.650 --> 00:02:32.985
Now, all they have to do is
build four walls around it

00:02:32.985 --> 00:02:34.286
and throw up a sign.

00:02:34.286 --> 00:02:37.624
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:37.624 --> 00:02:38.725
According --

00:02:40.026 --> 00:02:42.261
According to a new study,
going to bed too early

00:02:42.261 --> 00:02:44.630
or too late may disrupt
the body's natural rhythm

00:02:44.630 --> 00:02:46.899
and increase the risk
of cardiovascular disease.

00:02:46.899 --> 00:02:48.568
So, just to be safe, let's all

00:02:48.568 --> 00:02:51.870
randomly change our clocks
twice a year for no reason.

00:02:51.870 --> 00:02:53.139
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:53.139 --> 00:02:54.940
Nike has filed for trademarks

00:02:54.940 --> 00:02:56.743
for a new line
of virtual clothing.

00:02:56.743 --> 00:02:58.911
It'll be the first
Nike clothing line

00:02:58.911 --> 00:03:01.347
made entirely
by virtual children.

00:03:01.347 --> 00:03:02.682
[ Laughter and ohs ]

00:03:02.682 --> 00:03:04.884
Now...

00:03:05.852 --> 00:03:08.320
...when you guys didn't take
to the T.J.Maxx joke,

00:03:08.320 --> 00:03:10.456
I had a feeling --
[ Laughter ]

00:03:10.456 --> 00:03:13.559
I had a feeling this one was
going to be pretty bumpy, and...

00:03:13.559 --> 00:03:15.594
[ Laughter ]

00:03:15.594 --> 00:03:16.529
...called it.

00:03:16.529 --> 00:03:18.731
[ Laughter ]

00:03:18.731 --> 00:03:21.267
And, finally, former
New York Governor Andrew Cuomo

00:03:21.267 --> 00:03:24.136
over the weekend wished his dog
Captain a happy fourth birthday

00:03:24.136 --> 00:03:25.505
in a post on social media.

00:03:25.505 --> 00:03:28.373
Unfortunately, Captain
unfollowed him a long time ago.

00:03:28.373 --> 00:03:30.243
[ Laughter ]
And that was a monologue,
everybody!

